PQL.Assert
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated DAX calls functions from PQL.Assert
(https://github.com/clientfirsttech/PQL.Assert, published on DAX Lib),
Copyright (c) 2026 Client First Technologies, licensed under the MIT License.
pql-test records only PQL.Assert function names and argument order, as data,
in pql_test/odcs/catalog/. It does not bundle PQL.Assert's functions.tmdl.
The repository's tests use an unmodified copy of PQL.Assert 0.9.0 under
python/tests/odcs/fixtures/pql-assert-0.9.0/, with its MIT LICENSE; it is not
part of the published package.

